    "otto": "Read all 25 atoms, overview and reference. Checked metric gradients, continuity and constrained dissipation, finite-mass transport scaling, rarefaction signs and front speeds, low-regularity product counterexample, Gaussian semigroup proof, formal multi-index finiteness, polynomial recentering and reconstruction uniqueness. Independently checked LOTT §§2.2.5–2.3, including the transpose convention and uniform moment constants. JKO and LOTT research existence results remain citations.",
    "buffa": "Read all 18 atoms, overview and reference. Checked inverse-map cofactor formula, Cordes perturbation constants, curvature identity, residual recovery using surjectivity, conforming Galerkin and residual bounds, interface Hessian sign and determinant homotopy. General convex-domain regularity and RKC remain cited inputs.",
    "ziegler": "Read 2900–2903, 4Z01–4Z0D and reference. Checked the three Cauchy–Schwarz steps, cyclic cube lifting, inverse-theorem quantifier order, ordinary/logarithmic summation by parts and word-indicator expansion. Independently checked MRTTZ v3 Corollaries 1.6 and 1.11 and Theorem 1.9 against the exact claims. No full GTZ/MRTTZ research-proof review."
  },
